Name: gnome-autoar-0.4.4

    gnome-autoar 0.4.4 (zip/bundle handling lib) — needed by gnome-shell's extensions-tool subproject (the gnome-extensions CLI); the pristine upstream tarball (it ships a test fixture, tests/files/extract/test-symlink-parent/reference/arextract -> /tmp, which projeny admits as a leaf symlink: nothing extracts through it, and tests are not built)
